<para>Below are three systems of equations you saw earlier.</para>
<para>Use System A to answer questions 1 – 6.</para>
<para>System A</para>
<para>\(\left\{\begin{array}{c}4x+3y=10\;\\-4x+5y=6\end{array}\right.\)</para>

<!--Q#1-->
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the equations for System A that represent this scenario using the Desmos tool below.</item>
</list>
